---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/layout/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — Wrangle" description="Terms of service for using Wrangle.">
  <Nav />
  <main style="background: var(--navy-900); padding-top: 80px; min-height: 100vh;">
    <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 24px 100px;">
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 42px; color: white; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 8px;">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p style="font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(176,196,222,0.5); margin: 0 0 48px;">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <div class="legal-body">
        <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
        <p>By using Wrangle ("the Service"), you agree to these Terms. If you don't agree, don't use the Service.</p>

        <h2>2. Description</h2>
        <p>Wrangle is a mobile application that uses photo metadata to help you create and share travel guides. We are currently in invite-only beta.</p>

        <h2>3. Your content</h2>
        <p>You retain ownership of all photos and content you add to Wrangle. By publishing a guide, you grant us a limited license to host and serve that content to anyone with the guide link. You can revoke this by deleting the guide.</p>

        <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You may not use Wrangle to share content that is illegal, harmful, harassing, or infringes on others' intellectual property rights. We reserve the right to remove content and suspend accounts that violate these terms.</p>

        <h2>5. Beta service</h2>
        <p>The Service is provided in beta. Features may change, and we make no guarantee of uptime or data persistence. We'll provide reasonable notice before making breaking changes.</p>

        <h2>6. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>The Service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from your use of the Service.</p>

        <h2>7. Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance. We'll notify you by email of material changes.</p>

        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@getwrangle.app" style="color: #FF7A59;">hello@getwrangle.app</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .legal-body h2 {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px;
    color: white; margin: 40px 0 12px;
  }
  .legal-body p {
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; font-size: 16px;
    color: #B0C4DE; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
</style>
